* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
# The tests compare canonical JSON byte-for-byte and the serializer always emits
# LF. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf turns the fixture into
# CRLF and store_test's canonical checks fail (seen on GitHub Actions windows-latest).
*.json text eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
